  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_6f337e8179554c9792f5426508b78123",
      "statement": "The dispatcher `executeAgentInSandbox` in `lib/sandbox/agents/index.ts` is the single entry point the task worker uses to run an agent. It routes by the `AgentType` union (`'claude' | 'codex' | 'copilot' | 'cursor' | 'gemini' | 'opencode'`), snapshots and restores `process.env` for the seven agent-related env vars in a `finally` block, and dynamically fetches the user's GitHub token for the Copilot agent via `getUserGitHubToken`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/index.ts#L18-L159",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1beb5805187f7e26c660210742f3d306fee5a038564efeaa51d573b05e8dc70b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b5dc308a58d345f59c6801cb1df66b9e",
      "statement": "Every per-CLI wrapper exports an `executeXxxInSandbox` function that returns an `AgentExecutionResult`. The result shape is defined in `lib/sandbox/types.ts` as `success`, `output?`, `agentResponse?`, `cliName?`, `changesDetected?`, `error?`, `streamingLogs?`, `logs?`, `sessionId?`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/types.ts#L43-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a2b6382b973f6ad8928e2e8ad7383ddc58b37f01f2bc379e5caa1c589a9e0a1d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4d52f14c75274da5921079eefefb2e3f",
      "statement": "All six wrappers agree on four invariants: (1) repo-touching commands run via `runInProject` in `PROJECT_DIR = '/vercel/sandbox/project'`, (2) the wrappers never check `onCancellationCheck` themselves — the dispatcher does it once before the `switch`, (3) `changesDetected` is computed from `git status --porcelain` after the run, not from the CLI exit code, and (4) `success` reflects the CLI's exit code (0) rather than whether files were modified.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/index.ts#L37-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fef878774f7cab1004c716dbc22381d1d8775a566d986b8e2cc68742732ae1ff:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/commands.ts#L4-L76",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6ac3c7df717129a56e800ebec7b3357d3abcca15c7137e0a2a24937554133458:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d3d3ee92b5d24ddc8fb2039e3f7130da",
      "statement": "Three of the six wrappers (Claude, Cursor, Copilot) stream output incrementally into a single `taskMessages` row identified by `agentMessageId` and update it in place. Codex, Gemini, and OpenCode execute synchronously via `runInProject`/`runCommandInSandbox` and return the full captured output as `agentResponse` only when no streaming row is in play.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/claude.ts#L278-L423",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:08e279f697311f10920579938df782b4992b586b0bc5e4aaff8d17717bce21a6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/copilot.ts#L204-L246",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dad56b5825a9b9f676acd92b4345b77132f2bb79ba8791f5711ce91dbbe30f58:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/cursor.ts#L324-L428",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1f3747ab4c388ca48288173979c20dbd69c29fad942fa3b3401bbe174c5df75:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c6d6192995ff4630b6cfffdb548dae4b",
      "statement": "Five of the six wrappers support session resumption via `isResumed`/`sessionId`: Claude, Codex, Copilot, Cursor, and OpenCode. Gemini is the only wrapper that does not accept these parameters and instead relies on the continue route prefixing the prompt with the last five conversation messages. Codex is the only wrapper that ignores an explicit `sessionId` and always uses `codex resume --last` to continue the most recent session.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/api/tasks/%5BtaskId%5D/continue/route.ts#L248-L284",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:233e13e4916a6ec068299f3eaeaa9fdec9f47446d68bdabaec7969fa562796b3:"
        },
        {
