    {
      "id": "claim_0362b434ad524df2b44dc63a4e650e3d",
      "statement": "Codex branches its `~/.codex/config.toml` template on the API-key prefix: `vck_` keys produce a `vercel-ai-gateway` provider pointing at `https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1` with `wire_api = \"chat\"`; `sk-` keys produce an `openai` provider pointing at `https://api.openai.com/v1` with `wire_api = \"responses\"`. The wrapper refuses to run if the key starts with neither prefix.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/codex.ts#L88-L183",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a55c34cb16f0c27073ba696aea289287350167fbd2bf126c7e15435fdc771d37:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_640f4d54cfc14ca0bc6d5aeab94961e6",
      "statement": "Copilot is the only wrapper that fetches its auth credential dynamically: `executeAgentInSandbox` dynamically imports `getUserGitHubToken` and writes the result into both `process.env.GH_TOKEN` and `process.env.GITHUB_TOKEN` before the dispatch switch runs. The wrapper is also the only one that passes its MCP config via a CLI flag (`--additional-mcp-config @PATH`) rather than relying on a well-known file path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/copilot.ts#L171-L184",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d298528ef415227eddeead234ad7e785f81970139e3ea0eb9095344eca50623:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/sandbox/agents/index.ts#L51-L54",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:88e401b77cac05b713cda20c094ba88f05672e6cbd3477760074a6d4b4014d38:"
        },
        {
